WEBVTT

00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:13.560
Lala-chan, another pizza over here!

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:14.410
Capisce!

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:17.650
Lala, the deluxe pasta is done.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:19.370
Thank you for waiting, Señorita.

00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:21.080
Capisce!

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:23.060
Lala-chan, a pizza over here, too!

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:23.840
Capisce!

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:25.130
We'd like a menu.

00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:25.850
Capisce!

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:27.240
Is my salad done yet?

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:28.040
Capisce!

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:32.190
Onee-chan, isn't it about time you get going?

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:33.960
Eh?!

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:36.720
Mama, Papa, can I head to PriPara?

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:37.950
Have fun!

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:40.680
Tira-miss you!

00:00:44.470 --> 00:00:47.110
I'm Manaka Lala, 11 years old.

00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:49.110
I'm a PriPara idol.

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:53.230
PriPara is a world of girl's aspirations.

00:00:53.230 --> 00:00:56.870
At a certain age, young girls who receive PriTickets can attend PriPara.

00:00:56.870 --> 00:00:58.430
And any of them can be idols.

00:00:59.350 --> 00:01:02.180
Here girls can ascend through the rankings by performing concerts,

00:01:02.180 --> 00:01:04.050
and aim to eventually become a Divine Idol.

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:41.010
I've Started Being an Idol Again?!

00:02:41.780 --> 00:02:43.460
Thank you for coming.

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:46.180
Welcome to Prism Stone.

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:48.570
Mega-neesan, good afternoon.

00:02:48.570 --> 00:02:49.890
Yes, good afternoon.

00:02:57.630 --> 00:03:01.160
I see you have a lot more PriTickets, Manaka-san.

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:03.980
President Minami! Sophie-san!

00:03:03.980 --> 00:03:05.300
Morning.

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:07.440
We better get going.

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:09.680
We have something important to talk about.

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:11.460
Yeah, you're right.

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:18.920
PriPara change, complete!

00:03:20.730 --> 00:03:22.640
Ah! There's wings!

00:03:26.690 --> 00:03:28.640
Complete-pri!

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:31.140
There are!

00:03:34.870 --> 00:03:36.480
Finished.

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:39.440
Cute~!

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:44.140
They're freebies for the new term.

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:46.720
They're so cute!

00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:48.160
I'm excited.

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:50.220
Beautiful.

00:03:50.220 --> 00:03:52.870
Come on! We don't have much time.

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:01.570
It's SoLaMi SMILE!

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:04.970
Lala-chan, shake my hand!

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:06.630
Mireille-chan, give me your autograph!

00:04:06.630 --> 00:04:07.680
Sophie-san!

00:04:08.690 --> 00:04:11.110
They sure are popular-kuma.

00:04:11.110 --> 00:04:14.040
The three of them are major-ranked idols.

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:18.620
And when they got the legendary Paradise Coord to shine, they exploded into super idols!

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:21.610
And of course their success is because of me, their manager.

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:24.040
A 10 LDK...

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:28.380
No, a 20 LDK mansion may be within my grasp.

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:31.810
I'll be a celeb!

00:04:32.510 --> 00:04:34.520
This isn't the time to be daydreaming-kuma!

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:37.250
Hey, Lala, Sophie, Mireille!

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:38.780
Oh, Kuma-san!

00:04:38.780 --> 00:04:41.050
If you don't get a move on, you'll be late.

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:42.970
Sorry. I have to get going.

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:44.400
You can do it, Lala-chan!

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:45.580
We're cheering for you!

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:46.810
Thanks, everyone!

00:04:46.810 --> 00:04:48.530
See ya later-pri!

00:04:52.110 --> 00:04:53.780
Is this where we're supposed to be-pri?

00:04:53.780 --> 00:04:54.810
Yes-kuma.

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:56.210
So you're here too?

00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:56.770
Huh?

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:57.100
Kuma?

00:04:57.670 --> 00:04:58.800
Shion-san.

00:04:58.800 --> 00:04:59.750
Dorthy-san.

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:01.430
Leona-san.

00:05:01.430 --> 00:05:03.070
The three of you have wings too!

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:05.530
So cute! We match!

00:05:06.560 --> 00:05:08.310
So they called you guys too-pri?

00:05:08.310 --> 00:05:09.060
Yeah.

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:09.990
Naturally.

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:14.460
We need the max explanation about what happened the other day.

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:17.290
Your teams can't enter.

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:18.420
What?

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:19.330
There's got to be a mistake!
Why?

00:05:19.330 --> 00:05:20.250
Incomprehensible!

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:20.410
Why?

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:20.590
What's the meaning of this?
There's got to be a mistake!

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:21.780
Why?
What's the meaning of this?

00:05:21.780 --> 00:05:25.580
SoLaMi SMILE, Dressing Parfait,

00:05:25.580 --> 00:05:28.340
I have some important information for you.

00:05:28.670 --> 00:05:30.050
Mega-niisan.

00:05:30.710 --> 00:05:32.520
Both groups...

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:33.680
...are being disbanded!

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:35.640
Eh?!

00:05:35.970 --> 00:05:37.480
D-Disbanded?

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:38.570
Correct.

00:05:39.370 --> 00:05:41.650
SoLaMi SMILE is?

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:43.610
And Dressing Parfait?

00:05:43.870 --> 00:05:44.650
Yes.

00:05:45.220 --> 00:05:46.170
Why?

00:05:46.170 --> 00:05:47.280
This is news to me!

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:49.070
Lacking details!

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:50.740
I demand an explanation!

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:52.450
The reason is...

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:53.910
The reason is...?

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:57.080
It's rather complicated,

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:59.330
so I'll explain it at a later time.

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:02.360
I won't let it happen!

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:05.580
I'll force them to take it back!

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:06.850
Right, Leona?

00:06:06.850 --> 00:06:08.240
Y-Yeah.

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:10.090
If you say so, Dorthy.

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:13.490
It seems we're not the only ones here.

00:06:13.490 --> 00:06:16.630
Maybe they're going to fill us all in at the same time-usa?

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:18.060
Usa?

00:06:18.410 --> 00:06:20.020
Hey there!

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:22.940
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:06:23.880 --> 00:06:24.900
It's Mega-niisan!

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:27.860
I see you've all gathered together.

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:30.720
Let's start everyone's dream journey.

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:33.330
I'll be your guide on the PriPara Tour.

00:06:33.670 --> 00:06:36.570
Mega-nii, what's the deal with disbanding us-pri?

00:06:36.570 --> 00:06:38.410
We'll never accept it!

00:06:38.690 --> 00:06:41.670
We want to continue as a team!

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:45.460
I like shellfish, but don't like being shelved!

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:46.710
I second that!

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:48.670
I third that!

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:51.640
I fully understand your feelings.

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:56.100
On this tour, I shall give you a full explanation.

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:58.360
So please come aboard.

00:07:00.990 --> 00:07:03.210
Without further ado, let's sail off!

00:07:03.210 --> 00:07:04.370
Bon voyage!

00:07:04.370 --> 00:07:05.520
Off we go!

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:08.990
See you later-usa!
See you later-kuma!

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:09.010
See you later-usa!

00:07:09.010 --> 00:07:11.950
Make sure to fill us in later-usa!
Make sure to fill us in later-kuma!

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:12.820
Huh?

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:14.440
Kuma-san and the others aren't coming?

00:07:14.440 --> 00:07:15.340
Then...

00:07:15.340 --> 00:07:16.910
It's just Mega-nii and his accomplice, huh?

00:07:17.310 --> 00:07:21.330
Ladies, welcome to the PriPara Tour of Dreams.

00:07:22.140 --> 00:07:25.530
I shall be your guide, Akai Mega-nii.

00:07:25.530 --> 00:07:28.770
Once again, it is a pleasure to meet you.

00:07:28.770 --> 00:07:30.800
So cool!

00:07:31.100 --> 00:07:33.690
Just what are you starting-pri?

00:07:33.690 --> 00:07:37.870
For those of you still new to PriPara,

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:40.150
I shall give you a tour of PriPara Town.

00:07:40.150 --> 00:07:41.800
All right!

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:54.890
Now then, nothing's changed with this part of the town,

00:07:54.890 --> 00:07:59.920
but now we'll be moving onto PriPara's new area.

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:02.960
New area?

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:06.170
Ladies, please direct your attention to your right.

00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:10.010
Here you have some cute animals grazing.

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:11.090
They are!

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:11.470
Amazing!

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:12.220
Looks delicious

00:08:12.700 --> 00:08:14.900
Please direct your attention to your left.

00:08:15.570 --> 00:08:18.230
The pond you see here is shaped like a heart.

00:08:18.230 --> 00:08:18.470
Beautiful.

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:19.490
The gondoliers are so cute!

00:08:19.490 --> 00:08:20.570
How romantic!

00:08:20.570 --> 00:08:21.430
I want to go swimming!

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:25.860
Up front you can see a stylish outdoor cafe.

00:08:28.660 --> 00:08:31.050
Next, please direct your attention to me.

00:08:31.830 --> 00:08:34.640
Whoops, our eyes seem to have met.

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:36.200
Could this be fate?

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:41.570
You can probably see this area from Falala's room.

00:08:41.570 --> 00:08:43.850
This is the new area?

00:08:43.850 --> 00:08:45.210
I already knew about it-pri.

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:46.180
No-no.

00:08:46.180 --> 00:08:47.920
Our destination is up ahead.

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:52.480
Wow.

00:08:56.420 --> 00:08:58.260
What's with that building?

00:08:58.260 --> 00:08:59.790
Huge.

00:08:59.790 --> 00:09:01.720
It wasn't here before-pri.

00:09:09.180 --> 00:09:11.840
Ladies, please pay attention.

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:17.030
Passing through this gate will take you to our newly created live stage,

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:22.830
PriPara Dream Theatre.

00:09:23.050 --> 00:09:24.040
Yes.

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:27.470
A special live series will be performed here.

00:09:27.470 --> 00:09:28.290
Its name is...

00:09:29.850 --> 00:09:32.000
Idol Dream GrandPri!

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:34.520
Idol Dream GrandPri?

00:09:34.520 --> 00:09:36.620
It's here because of certain events.

00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:38.320
Because of certain events?

00:09:38.320 --> 00:09:40.720
I still don't understand a single thing you've said.

00:09:40.950 --> 00:09:43.870
Let me explain PriPara.

00:09:45.130 --> 00:09:47.440
Mega-nii Monitor, switch on!

00:09:48.320 --> 00:09:53.390
Along with this event, a new system will be used this year:

00:09:53.390 --> 00:09:54.900
PriPara Dream Parade.

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:55.880
So pretty.

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:56.310
It's beautiful.

00:09:56.310 --> 00:09:56.710
Totally cute!

00:09:56.710 --> 00:09:57.360
Amazing!

00:09:57.950 --> 00:10:00.830
Gorgeous floats will be paraded around town,

00:10:01.230 --> 00:10:03.890
making it PriPara's greatest festival.

00:10:03.890 --> 00:10:10.250
And the Dream Team, made up of five members who outshine the rest, will ride on the lead float.

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:11.620
Five?!

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:12.710
Not three?

00:10:13.260 --> 00:10:14.170
Five people.

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:16.840
But we've always been in three person teams!

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:18.880
The Dream Team is to be made up of five members.

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:23.350
I am terribly sorry, but it's part of the system.

00:10:23.580 --> 00:10:25.100
I see.

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:27.560
So that's why you've disbanded our groups.

00:10:30.610 --> 00:10:32.980
To announce the parade's commencement,

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:39.910
the selected five will ring the Charm Bell of Beginnings.

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:44.870
It's a legendary PriPara item on par with the Paradise Coord.

00:10:45.520 --> 00:10:49.330
I've also heard that it will grant any wish of the ones who ring it.

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:50.490
Eh?!

00:10:50.490 --> 00:10:51.750
Any wish?

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:52.990
Really-pri?!

00:10:52.990 --> 00:10:53.780
Yes.

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:58.670
Pri!

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:00.590
Pushuu~.

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:01.930
Hmph!

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:05.380
Question!

00:11:05.380 --> 00:11:07.890
How are those five chosen?

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:09.600
Good question.

00:11:10.340 --> 00:11:16.570
The five will be chosen in the Idol Dream GrandPri live series that I mentioned earlier.

00:11:17.150 --> 00:11:20.820
From amongst the teams that enter,

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:26.950
four times a year a different shinning Dream Team will be nominated for the GrandPri.

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:29.520
And then at the end of that year,

00:11:29.520 --> 00:11:33.210
the Dream Team that wins the GrandPri...

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:38.670
Those five will be given the parade's leading roles.

00:11:38.970 --> 00:11:42.940
So we just need to be the ones who shine the brightest.

00:11:42.940 --> 00:11:44.640
Five person teams...

00:11:44.640 --> 00:11:48.640
I wonder what a five person concert will feel like.

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:52.010
Why don't we have a simulation?

00:11:52.010 --> 00:11:57.590
Mega-nii is yours.

00:11:58.820 --> 00:12:01.240
Lala-san, would you like to give it a try?

00:12:26.900 --> 00:12:28.100
That's right!

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:29.430
Looking good.

00:12:30.920 --> 00:12:32.170
Can you do it?

00:12:32.170 --> 00:12:32.820
Yes.

00:12:32.820 --> 00:12:34.550
It's a wonderful song.

00:12:34.550 --> 00:12:37.720
It's a song from the Idol Dream GrandPri.

00:12:37.720 --> 00:12:39.000
Have you memorised it?

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:39.690
Yep!

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:44.430
Then we shall watch from the audience.

00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:45.770
Do your best.

00:12:45.770 --> 00:12:47.660
We'll be cheering for you!

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:48.440
Thanks!

00:12:48.440 --> 00:12:50.870
Oh yeah, you'll need this.

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:54.370
Don't forget this Cyalume Charm.

00:12:55.390 --> 00:12:57.130
Cyalume Charm?

00:13:01.980 --> 00:13:04.950
Please scan the appropriate number of <i>My Tickets</i> for your coord.

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:07.850
Coord Change Start!

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:15.350
Lala-chan's new coord is a lovely one full of lace and ribbons which gives off a feeling of springtime.

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:16.940
Dream Heart Race Coord!

00:13:54.350 --> 00:13:56.610
Lala multiplied-pri!

00:13:56.610 --> 00:14:00.310
It mimics a five person Dream Team concert with the use of holograms.

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:37.730
Making Drama Switch On!

00:14:40.210 --> 00:14:41.310
Aim to dance!

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:44.730
Walk the runway!

00:14:47.640 --> 00:14:49.240
And to sing!

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:53.280
Let's go PriPara!

00:14:55.680 --> 00:14:58.550
Cyalume Change!

00:15:56.550 --> 00:15:58.970
Huh? It turned pink.

00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:02.810
Lala-san, that was a superb live.

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:04.770
Nicely done.

00:16:06.140 --> 00:16:11.940
That Cyalume Charm symbolises that you are taking part in the Idol Dream GrandPri,

00:16:11.940 --> 00:16:14.250
so please take good care of it.

00:16:14.250 --> 00:16:17.200
Um, why did it change colour?

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:21.160
That's your appeal, and the charm reflects that.

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:24.060
The colour pink represents lovely.

00:16:24.060 --> 00:16:28.490
You increased your lovely ranking with that concert you performed.

00:16:29.010 --> 00:16:33.630
Also, this data is used when evaluating the Dream Teams.

00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:35.400
I see.

00:16:35.400 --> 00:16:38.560
And while that concludes my explanation,

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:40.350
I have one final question.

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:46.220
Would you ladies be willing to take part in the Idol Dream GrandPri?

00:16:46.220 --> 00:16:47.390
Or not?

00:16:47.390 --> 00:16:48.020
Huh?

00:16:48.640 --> 00:16:52.290
This project uses a completely new system.

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:55.760
Divine Idol, Major Idol, Understudy...

00:16:55.760 --> 00:16:57.990
All of them will be starting from level one.

00:16:58.430 --> 00:17:02.490
In other words, while this provides a level starting field for everyone,

00:17:03.270 --> 00:17:05.710
as only five person teams are allowed,

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:10.920
you'll need to make adjustments as things like compatibility are more complicated than in three person teams.

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:13.990
Please take your time to think about it.

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:22.000
The stars of the parade will be that five person team.

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:24.770
The GrandPri Live at the Dream Theatre.

00:17:25.510 --> 00:17:29.270
And the Charm Bell of Beginnings that is said to grant wishes.

00:17:29.710 --> 00:17:31.290
I want to do it!

00:17:31.290 --> 00:17:32.480
I want to try!

00:17:38.480 --> 00:17:39.780
I'll do it!

00:17:40.300 --> 00:17:41.660
Of course I'm in!

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:44.040
I'd also like to try.

00:17:44.460 --> 00:17:46.790
Sturm und Drang!  Exactly what I'm looking for!

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:49.540
I'm the only one fitting for that leading role.

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:51.090
I'll also do my best!

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:54.480
Well, it seems like they're letting anyone try.

00:17:54.480 --> 00:17:56.550
So I guess I'll do it too.

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:59.660
I think I'll just keep doing what I've been doing.

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:00.510
Yeah.

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:01.970
Understood.

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:07.050
Now then, I shall hand these Cyalume Charms out to those who wish to participate.

00:18:07.890 --> 00:18:13.620
Your team will be recognised when all of your Cylume Charms flash at the same time.

00:18:13.620 --> 00:18:17.400
Please do your best and search for your destined group!

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:19.500
Destined group, huh?

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:21.120
That sounds kind of romantic.

00:18:21.510 --> 00:18:25.830
Who knows. This may lead to the birth of unforeseen teams.

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:27.800
Unforeseen...?

00:18:27.800 --> 00:18:31.340
For example, if I teamed up with Shion-san...

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:34.560
Or I teamed up with Dorthy...

00:18:34.560 --> 00:18:39.170
Does that mean I could team up with Sophie-san?

00:18:39.170 --> 00:18:40.760
Not in a million years.

00:18:46.700 --> 00:18:49.790
Ladies, thank you for riding with us.

00:18:49.790 --> 00:18:52.370
Let's go on another fun journey some day.

00:18:52.370 --> 00:18:55.860
I wish everyone good luck in their future endeavours.

00:18:55.860 --> 00:18:58.420
Thank you very much.

00:18:58.420 --> 00:18:59.410
Hello there!

00:18:59.410 --> 00:19:00.570
Thank you for waiting!

00:19:01.260 --> 00:19:05.460
I'll be your guide on the PriPara Tour, a dream journey for everyone.

00:19:05.460 --> 00:19:07.430
Please come aboard.

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:13.070
So he's planning on explaining the system to all idols.

00:19:13.070 --> 00:19:15.070
He's got it pretty rough, doesn't he?

00:19:15.070 --> 00:19:16.350
That must take a lot of energy.

00:19:16.350 --> 00:19:18.390
Welcome back-kuma.

00:19:18.390 --> 00:19:21.600
Do you fully understand the new system-kuma?

00:19:21.600 --> 00:19:22.380
Yeah.

00:19:22.380 --> 00:19:25.400
We've all decided to take part in the GrandPri.

00:19:25.400 --> 00:19:26.850
See?

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:29.120
Exactly what I'd expect of an idol.

00:19:29.120 --> 00:19:31.130
You're motivated and putting everything into it-kuma.

00:19:31.130 --> 00:19:33.270
First we need to form a five person team.

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:38.130
We need to quickly find two new members so we can reform SoLaMi Smile.

00:19:38.130 --> 00:19:38.990
Capisce.

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:40.220
We'll do the same!

00:19:40.220 --> 00:19:41.820
We'll reform first.

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:42.950
We won't lose-usa.

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:47.440
It seems we're missing two people.

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:51.800
Jello!

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:52.580
What?

00:19:54.100 --> 00:19:56.070
Sorry I'm late-nano.

00:19:56.070 --> 00:19:59.090
I'm Mikan, nice to meet you-nano.

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:02.930
Jelly-jelly Angely!

00:20:04.260 --> 00:20:05.390
Cute!

00:20:05.890 --> 00:20:08.900
Aloma~! Let's get going!

00:20:11.430 --> 00:20:13.860
You lot of fools.

00:20:13.860 --> 00:20:16.310
You dare stand in my way?

00:20:16.690 --> 00:20:17.770
Huh?

00:20:18.590 --> 00:20:21.990
Then feast your eyes on my demonic power!

00:20:21.990 --> 00:20:22.660
Huh?!

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:23.450
Demonic?

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:26.220
Derodero Derosaimu...

00:20:26.220 --> 00:20:30.410
Demon Demon Deruderu Beam!

00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:32.870
Scary!

00:20:32.870 --> 00:20:34.430
Stand aside!

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:36.580
A path has appeared.

00:20:36.580 --> 00:20:37.840
Thank you-nano!

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:49.890
You're Mikan-san and Aloma-san, correct?

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:51.540
I've been waiting for you.

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:52.580
I'm Mikan-nano.

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:54.200
The name is Aloma.

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:55.510
Please come aboard.

00:20:55.510 --> 00:20:57.880
Be an angel to me!

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:01.610
Without further ado, let's sail off!

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:02.630
Bon voyage!

00:21:02.630 --> 00:21:04.440
What's with those two?

00:21:04.440 --> 00:21:06.360
They're pretty intense.

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:08.830
They sure take their roles seriously.

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:13.470
It's said that PriPara is bustling with all types of idols.

00:21:13.470 --> 00:21:17.290
And I shall find the best partners from amongst them.

00:21:17.580 --> 00:21:19.370
We won't lose-pri!

00:21:19.370 --> 00:21:21.710
Yeah.

00:21:22.070 --> 00:21:24.260
Things have become really exciting.

00:21:24.260 --> 00:21:27.770
The Idol Dream GrandPri sure sounds like a lot of fun!

00:21:27.770 --> 00:21:30.430
All right, first we need to make our teams!

00:21:30.430 --> 00:21:31.900
Let's do our best!

00:21:31.900 --> 00:21:33.640
Yeah!

00:23:05.770 --> 00:23:08.400
SoLaMi Smile can't reform?

00:23:08.400 --> 00:23:09.720
Why?!

00:23:10.270 --> 00:23:13.730
Lala, you are already under my curse.

00:23:13.730 --> 00:23:15.370
If you become friends with Mikan and Aloma,

00:23:15.370 --> 00:23:17.320
you can recieve the blessings of heaven!

00:23:17.320 --> 00:23:19.960
A demon and angel? What do you mean by that?

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:22.630
Your fate is to serve under us.

00:23:22.630 --> 00:23:25.740
We'll form a team and aim for the gates of heaven together!

00:23:25.740 --> 00:23:26.500
What?

00:23:26.500 --> 00:23:28.760
Even if you say that...

00:23:28.760 --> 00:23:29.660
Next time:

00:23:29.660 --> 00:23:31.780
Angel and Demon Neko~n.

00:23:31.780 --> 00:23:33.300
Aim for your dreams!

00:23:33.300 --> 00:23:34.800
Let's go PriPara!
